	<http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/synbiohub#bookmark> "false" ;
	<http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/synbiohub#mutableNotes> "<P> <P>2 silent point mutants were introduced in the coding sequence to remove internal      XbaI and PstI sites. Mutation sites were chosen to replace codons commonly      used in <em>E. coli</em> with codons used at a similar frequency. <P>" ;
